    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Normal Gu Masters who lack patience for grinding work can ask universe path Gu Masters for help, or use a universe path Gu themselves, to accelerate their time. Fang Yuan does not. He holds Spring Autumn Cicada, so accelerating his time would also increase that Gu’s recovery speed, which he treats as a death warrant. San Cha mountain’s blessed land already runs three times faster than the outside world, and time spent in King Quan Inheritance has already let Spring Autumn Cicada recover some, so he keeps to bitter cultivation.",
        "chapters": [
