  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "More than a month after leaving King Quan Inheritance, Fang Yuan is almost finished with ancient bronze skin Gu and still far from mastering essence iron bone Gu. He considers using universe path Gu to accelerate the flow of time. Universe path is related to time. Gu Masters of this path use time related Gu worms. Third watch Gu and Spring Autumn Cicada belong to this category. There are far more universe path Gu than those two. Universe path has a full range of Gu from rank one to rank five.",
        "chapters": [
          355
        ],
